  <ellipse cx="200" cy="200" rx="190" ry="60" transform="rotate(36 200 200)"/>
  <ellipse cx="200" cy="200" rx="190" ry="60" transform="rotate(54 200 200)"/>
  <ellipse cx="200" cy="200" rx="190" ry="60" transform="rotate(72 200 200)"/>
  <ellipse cx="200" cy="200" rx="190" ry="60" transform="rotate(90 200 200)"/>
  <ellipse cx="200" cy="200" rx="190" ry="60" transform="rotate(108 200 200)"/>
  <ellipse cx="200" cy="200" rx="190" ry="60" transform="rotate(126 200 200)"/>
  <ellipse cx="200" cy="200" rx="190" ry="60" transform="rotate(144 200 200)"/>
  <ellipse cx="200" cy="200" rx="190" ry="60" transform="rotate(162 200 200)"/>
</g></svg>
<svg class="rosette r2" viewBox="0 0 400 400" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="#F2ECD7" stroke-width="1">
  <ellipse cx="200" cy="200" rx="190" ry="60"/>
  <ellipse cx="200" cy="200" rx="190" ry="60" transform="rotate(18 200 200)"/>
  <ellipse cx="200" cy="200" rx="190" ry="60" transform="rotate(36 200 200)"/>
  <ellipse cx="200" cy="200" rx="190" ry="60" transform="rotate(54 200 200)"/>
  <ellipse cx="200" cy="200" rx="190" ry="60" transform="rotate(72 200 200)"/>
  <ellipse cx="200" cy="200" rx="190" ry="60" transform="rotate(90 200 200)"/>
  <ellipse cx="200" cy="200" rx="190" ry="60" transform="rotate(108 200 200)"/>
  <ellipse cx="200" cy="200" rx="190" ry="60" transform="rotate(126 200 200)"/>
  <ellipse cx="200" cy="200" rx="190" ry="60" transform="rotate(144 200 200)"/>
  <ellipse cx="200" cy="200" rx="190" ry="60" transform="rotate(162 200 200)"/>
</g></svg>

<!-- ── MASTHEAD ─────────────────────────────── -->
<header class="mast">
  <div class="kicker">
    <span>A broadside of limericks · one name, repeated</span>
    <span class="ref">Ref. Nº AABBA / 25</span>
  </div>
  <h1>BILL<span class="dot">.</span> <span class="x">×25</span></h1>
  <div class="mast-grid">
    <p class="lede">Twenty-five limericks about people named <em>Bill</em> — the plumber, the duck, the astronaut, the man who is, per one <em>economist</em>, simply a data point. Each one five lines, each one <strong>A·A·B·B·A</strong>, each one free of charge. Read all twenty-five to settle the account.</p>
    <div class="mast-side">
      <div class="stamp">25 Bills<br>No Extra Charge<br>A·A·B·B·A</div>
      <div class="rhythm">
        <span class="rh-label">Rhythm, as per invoice</span>
        <div class="rh-row"><b>A</b><span>da</span><span>da</span><span class="dum">DUM</span><span class="sep">·</span><span>da</span><span>da</span><span class="dum">DUM</span></div>
        <div class="rh-row"><b>B</b><span>da</span><span>da</span><span class="sep">·</span><span>da</span><span>da</span></div>
        <div class="rh-row"><b>A</b><span>da</span><span>da</span><span class="dum">DUM</span><span class="sep">·</span><span>da</span><span>da</span><span class="dum">DUM</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ── TICKER ───────────────────────────────── -->
<div class="ticker" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="ticker-track">
    <div class="tk-half">
      <span>The Plumber Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Baker Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Duck Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Astronaut Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Bill, per the Economist <b>✕</b></span><span>The Dog Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Pirate Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The DJ Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Gardener Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Chess Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Fisherman Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Bookkeeper Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Cyclist Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Lighthouse Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Boxer Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Cat Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Detective Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Forecaster Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Composer Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Librarian Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Elephant Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Bell-Ringer Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Inventor Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Magician Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Last Bill <b>✕</b></span>
    </div>
    <div class="tk-half">
      <span>The Plumber Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Baker Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Duck Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Astronaut Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Bill, per the Economist <b>✕</b></span><span>The Dog Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Pirate Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The DJ Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Gardener Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Chess Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Fisherman Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Bookkeeper Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Cyclist Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Lighthouse Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Boxer Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Cat Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Detective Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Forecaster Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Composer Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Librarian Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Elephant Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Bell-Ringer Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Inventor Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Magician Bill <b>✕</b></span><span>The Last Bill <b>✕</b></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ── THE LEDGER ───────────────────────────── -->
<main class="ledger" id="ledger">

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">01</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Plumber Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">There once was a plumber called Bill,</p>
      <p class="ln">Whose pipes made a musical trill.</p>
      <p class="ln b">With a wrench as his wand,</p>
      <p class="ln b">All the drip-drips were banned,</p>
      <p class="ln">And the pipes played a jig for Bill.</p>
      <span class="bill-tag">The classic opener</span>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">02</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Baker Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">A baker named Bill in the town</p>
      <p class="ln">Rose at four with a floury frown.</p>
      <p class="ln b">He’d let the dough rise</p>
      <p class="ln b">And give it a surprise—</p>
      <p class="ln">A slap, a slash, and a flour crown.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">03</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Duck Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">The duck named Bill had a bill</p>
      <p class="ln">That quacked like a kettle, quite shrill.</p>
      <p class="ln b">At the corner of the dock</p>
      <p class="ln b">The others paused to look,</p>
      <p class="ln">And Bill did the duck with his bill.</p>
      <span class="bill-tag">Pun ×2 — one Bill has two</span>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">04</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Astronaut Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">Astronaut Bill, to the moon,</p>
      <p class="ln">Packed his sandwiches, cheese, and his tune.</p>
      <p class="ln b">“The flag’s in position,</p>
      <p class="ln b">My name’s in the mission—</p>
      <p class="ln">Just read the big letters: Bill Moon.”</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">05</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Bill, per the Economist</h2>
      <p class="ln">An economist, sharp as a drill,</p>
      <p class="ln">Said, “I’ll stake my last chart on this Bill.”</p>
      <p class="ln b">His Jurgen, who’d watched</p>
      <p class="ln b">From the very first scratch,</p>
      <p class="ln">Nodded: “Bet on him, Bill — he’s a thrill.”</p>
      <span class="bill-tag g">Staff: economist · Guest: Jurgen</span>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">06</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Dog Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">A dog named Bill by the gate</p>
      <p class="ln">Would wait till the postman got late,</p>
      <p class="ln b">Then fetch the morning paper,</p>
      <p class="ln b">Drop it with a clapper,</p>
      <p class="ln">And tail-wag for treats — no debate.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">07</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Pirate Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">A pirate named Bill in his galleon</p>
      <p class="ln">Kept his treasure in prime condition.</p>
      <p class="ln b">He’d bury the booty</p>
      <p class="ln b">While parrots were jolly,</p>
      <p class="ln">And split it all fairly — ’tis Bill’s galleon.</p>
      <span class="bill-tag">Financial advice: none</span>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">08</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The DJ Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">A DJ named Bill with his mix</p>
      <p class="ln">Could keep any bassline till six.</p>
      <p class="ln b">The subwoofers moaned,</p>
      <p class="ln b">The chandeliers groaned,</p>
      <p class="ln">And the council up top came to fix.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">09</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Gardener Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">A gardener, Bill, with his rake</p>
      <p class="ln">Would talk to his tulips and oak.</p>
      <p class="ln b">“Grow up, you laggards!”</p>
      <p class="ln b">He’d lecture the cabbages,</p>
      <p class="ln">And the cabbages grew into cake.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">10</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Chess Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">A chess master, Bill, and his queen</p>
      <p class="ln">Had a strategy no one had seen:</p>
      <p class="ln b">The knight goes in low,</p>
      <p class="ln b">And the bishop goes slow,</p>
      <p class="ln">And checkmate appears in between.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">11</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Fisherman Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">A fisherman, Bill, with his net</p>
      <p class="ln">Cast at first light, the lake still wet.</p>
      <p class="ln b">He’d reel in a bream</p>
      <p class="ln b">That was humming a dream,</p>
      <p class="ln">But the trout swam off, full of regret.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">12</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Bookkeeper Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">A bookkeeper, Bill, wrote his bills</p>
      <p class="ln">In a hand as fine as a frill.</p>
      <p class="ln b">If a penny was missing,</p>
      <p class="ln b">He’d find it while fixing</p>
      <p class="ln">His ledger with patient skill.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">13</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Cyclist Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">A cyclist, Bill, in the sprint</p>
      <p class="ln">Wore a jersey that matched every print.</p>
      <p class="ln b">He’d drop back and grin,</p>
      <p class="ln b">Then attack with the spin,</p>
      <p class="ln">And coast in first, holding a pint.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">14</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Lighthouse Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">Lighthouse Bill, with his great light</p>
      <p class="ln">Kept the whole of the coast safe each night.</p>
      <p class="ln b">He’d signal the boats:</p>
      <p class="ln b">“Slow down, you old oats—</p>
      <p class="ln">Come in under cover of light.”</p>
      <span class="bill-tag g">Certified light</span>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">15</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Boxer Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">A boxer, Bill, with his swing</p>
      <p class="ln">Rattled the judges and the ring</p>
      <p class="ln b">And the referee</p>
      <p class="ln b">With a left and a flurry—</p>
      <p class="ln">Then took the gold belt and bowed like a king.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">16</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Cat Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">The cat named Bill on the sill</p>
      <p class="ln">Kept his whiskers aligned in a frill.</p>
      <p class="ln b">Offer him a sardine:</p>
      <p class="ln b">He pretends, unseen—</p>
      <p class="ln">Then gobbles it, one long thrill.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">17</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Detective Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">A detective, Bill, found his clue</p>
      <p class="ln">In a smudge on a shoe.</p>
      <p class="ln b">“Case closed,” he’d declare—</p>
      <p class="ln b">The crook was right there,</p>
      <p class="ln">And the alibi fell through.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">18</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Forecaster Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">A forecaster, Bill, made the cast</p>
      <p class="ln">That it would hold dry to the last.</p>
      <p class="ln b">Then the sky opened up</p>
      <p class="ln b">On his coffee-cup—</p>
      <p class="ln">“Forecast: wet. That was a blast.”</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">19</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Composer Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">A composer, Bill, wrote a waltz</p>
      <p class="ln">That the orchestra fumbled with faults.</p>
      <p class="ln b">“The strings play too slow!”</p>
      <p class="ln b">And the tubas would blow</p>
      <p class="ln">Till the last note fell with a fault.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">20</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Librarian Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">A librarian, Bill, charged the fine</p>
      <p class="ln">One penny a week — by design.</p>
      <p class="ln b">An overdue book</p>
      <p class="ln b">Would catch a long look,</p>
      <p class="ln">And the fine ticked up, line upon line.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">21</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Elephant Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">An elephant, Bill, with his trunk</p>
      <p class="ln">Would sip up the pond till he was drunk.</p>
      <p class="ln b">The rangers cried, “Bill!”</p>
      <p class="ln b">And the elephants, still,</p>
      <p class="ln">Just winked from their trunks.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">22</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Bell-Ringer Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">A bell ringer, Bill, with the bell</p>
      <p class="ln">Kept the whole parish tick-tocking well.</p>
      <p class="ln b">“The hour’s on the wing!”</p>
      <p class="ln b">He’d holler and sing—</p>
      <p class="ln">And it rang out the hour, the knell.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">23</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Inventor Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">An inventor, Bill, with a wrench</p>
      <p class="ln">Built his rockets on the bench.</p>
      <p class="ln b">“If it won’t take flight,</p>
      <p class="ln b">We rewire it overnight.”</p>
      <p class="ln">It flew — and the neighbors packed up the bench.</p>
      <span class="bill-tag">Home insurance: denied</span>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">24</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Magician Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">A magician, Bill, with his hat</p>
      <p class="ln">Pulled out rabbits the size of a cat.</p>
      <p class="ln b">“One more rabbit, Bill!”</p>
      <p class="ln b">He’d say, with a will—</p>
      <p class="ln">“The last one’s a cat. That’s that.”</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="bill">
    <div class="bill-rail"><span class="bill-num">25</span><span class="bill-meter">A·A·B·B·A</span></div>
    <div class="bill-body">
      <h2 class="bill-title">The Last Bill</h2>
      <p class="ln">So wherever you meet up with Bill,</p>
      <p class="ln">Whether plumber or duck, he’s still</p>
      <p class="ln b">Just a bloke with a name</p>
      <p class="ln b">And a limerick’s fame—</p>
      <p class="ln">Give him one. That’s the bill.</p>
      <span class="bill-tag g">Terms: none. Sign anywhere.</span>
    </div>
  </article>

</main>

<!-- ── COLOPHON ─────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="colophon">
  <div class="colo-grid">
    <div>
      <h3 class="colo-h">Colophon</h3>
      <p class="colo-p">Printed in anapests. Set in Anton, Fraunces &amp; Space Grotesk. Scansion approximate; puns exact. No bills were harmed in the making of this page — several were sent, and one of them quacked.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="idx-label">Specimens on file</span>
      <span class="idx-chip hot">bill ×25</span>
      <span class="idx-chip hot">economist</span>
      <span class="idx-chip hot">jurgen</span>
      <span class="idx-chip">…and 24 other trades</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>A broadside in five lines · return postage to the limerick itself · © the year of the Bill</footer>

<!-- ── FIXED UI ─────────────────────────────── -->
<div class="meter" id="meter" role="status" aria-live="polite">
  <span class="ball" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span><span class="word">Bills read&nbsp;</span><b id="count">00</b>/25</span>
</div>
<button class="deal" id="dealBtn" type="button">Deal me a Bill</button>

<div class="modal" id="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modalTitle" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-card">
    <div class="deal-stamp" id="dealStamp" aria-hidden="true">DEALT</div>
    <h3 id="modalTitle"></h3>
    <div class="modal-verse" id="modalVerse"></div>
    <div class="modal-actions">
      <button class="btn red" id="redBtn" type="button">Redeal</button>
      <button class="btn" id="closeBtn" type="button">Back to the ledger</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="paid" id="paid" role="presentation">
  <div class="paid-box">
    <span>PAID IN FULL</span>
    <small>All 25 bills read · the duck accepts no further payment · tap to dismiss</small>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
(function(){
  var bills   = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.bill'));
  var read    = {};
  var readN   = 0;
  var countEl = document.getElementById('count');
  var fill    = document.getElementById('payfill');
  var meter   = document.getElementById('meter');
  var body    = document.body;
  var reduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;

  function paint(){
    countEl.textContent = ('0' + readN).slice(-2);
    fill.style.width = (readN / bills.length * 100) + '%';
    if (readN === bills.length && !body.classList.contains('paid')){
      body.classList.add('paid');
      meter.lastChild.innerHTML = '<b>PAID</b> · 25/25';
      var paid = document.getElementById('paid');
      if (!reduced) paid.classList.add('show');
      setTimeout(function(){ paid.classList.remove('show'); }, 5000);
    }
  }

  if ('IntersectionObserver' in window){
    var io = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){
      entries.forEach(function(e){
        if (e.isIntersecting){
          e.target.classList.add('in');
          if (!read[e.target.id || bills.indexOf(e.target)]){
            read[e.target.id || bills.indexOf(e.target)] = true;
            readN++;
            paint();
          }
          io.unobserve(e.target);
        }
      });
    }, {threshold: 0.35});
    bills.forEach(function(b){ io.observe(b); });
  } else {
    bills.forEach(function(b){ b.classList.add('in'); });
  }

  /* ── Deal a Bill ── */
  var modal    = document.getElementById('modal');
  var mTitle   = document.getElementById('modalTitle');
  var mVerse   = document.getElementById('modalVerse');
  var stampEl  = document.getElementById('dealStamp');
  var openBtn  = document.getElementById('dealBtn');
  var closeBtn = document.getElementById('closeBtn');
  var redBtn   = document.getElementById('redBtn');
  var last     = -1;

  var data = bills.map(function(el){
    return {
      num:   el.querySelector('.bill-num').textContent.trim(),
      title: el.querySelector('.bill-title').textContent.trim(),
      lines: Array.prototype.slice.call(el.querySelectorAll('.ln')).map(function(p){ return p.textContent.trim(); })
    };
  });

  function openModal(){
    modal.classList.add('open');
    modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');
    closeBtn.focus();
  }
  function closeModal(){
    modal.classList.remove('open');
    modal.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');
    openBtn.focus();
  }
  function deal(){
    var i;
    do { i = Math.floor(Math.random() * data.length); } while (i === last && data.length > 1);
    last = i;
    var d = data[i];
    mTitle.textContent = 'Limerick Nº ' + d.num + ' — ' + d.title;
    mVerse.innerHTML = '';
    d.lines.forEach(function(t, idx){
      var p = document.createElement('p');
      p.className = 'ln' + ((idx === 2 || idx === 3) ? ' b' : '');
      p.textContent = t;
      mVerse.appendChild(p);
    });
    stampEl.classList.remove('pop');
    void stampEl.offsetWidth;
    stampEl.classList.add('pop');
    openModal();
  }

  openBtn.addEventListener('click', deal);
  redBtn .addEventListener('click', deal);
  closeBtn.addEventListener('click', closeModal);
  modal .addEventListener('click', function(e){ if (e.target === modal) closeModal(); });
  window .addEventListener('keydown', function(e){ if (e.key === 'Escape' && modal.classList.contains('open')) closeModal(); });

  document.getElementById('paid').addEventListener('click', function(){ this.classList.remove('show'); });
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
```

**What's inside:** all 25 limericks (plumber, duck, astronaut, pirate, elephant, and more — one featuring the economist and his friend Jurgen), each tagged A·A·B·B·A with the B-lines visually set apart. Interactions: lines bounce in one by one as you scroll, the top bar fills as your "bill" is settled, the corner meter counts bills read (finishing all 25 slams a **PAID IN FULL** stamp), and the "Deal me a Bill" button deals a random limerick into a stamped card. Keywords *bill*, *economist*, and *jurgen* appear in the poems and the colophon's specimen index, and all motion respects `prefers-reduced-motion`.

