          <span class="ln">One a minute, no less — every one a trick;</span>
          <span class="ln">He’d rhyme town with frown,</span>
          <span class="ln">And he’d rhyme Bill with June,</span>
          <span class="ln">And the twenty-fifth — this one — he wrote quick.</span>
        </p>
        <div class="note"><b>Marginalia</b>The reviewer declines to disclose which method he used.</div>
        <span class="stamp" aria-hidden="true">Read aloud</span>
      </article>

      <article class="lim rev" id="lim-17">
        <div class="lim-head"><span class="num">XVII</span><span class="place">The Bill of the Golden Kazoo</span>
