        </div>
        <div class="lim-rule"></div>
        <p class="poem">
          <span class="ln">There was a soccer-Bill with a famous left boot;</span>
          <span class="ln">Who’d bend up his free-kicks — a wobble, a whoot;</span>
          <span class="ln">He’d score at the top,</span>
          <span class="ln">And the goalposts did pop,</span>
          <span class="ln">And the stadium chanted: “BOOT! BOOT! BOOT! BOOT!”</span>
        </p>
        <div class="note"><b>Marginalia</b>The goalposts, under inquiry, are recovering.</div>
        <span class="stamp" aria-hidden="true">Read aloud</span>
      </article>

      <article class="lim rev" id="lim-21">
        <div class="lim-head"><span class="num">XXI</span><span class="place">The Chef of the Soufflé</span>
